{"version":1,"content":"<p>張智霖（Chilam）日前擔任葉念琛YouTube頻道《Meaningful》嘉賓，從新秀歌手到TVB當家小生，再到《衝上雲霄II》的Captain Cool，張智霖剖白入行30多年的心路歷程。</p><p>他在《璀璨之城》首次挑戰極暗黑角色，打破自己以往形象。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.049006+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:43:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T09:37:42.837933+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684322+00:00","content_hash":"d506135950435e7a4df15767187f77e6057556dafc4627f7da76320b6cfb088a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}